# HELIX NEXUS — local environment template
#
# THIS FILE LIVES IN AI_CODE/, NOT SERVER_APPLICATIONS/ — that was an
# earlier mistake in the instructions, caught via real testing (D-023)
# and corrected. bom_review_agent.py looks for ".env" in its own folder
# (AI_CODE/) specifically, regardless of where you run a script from.
#
# Copy this file to ".env" in this same folder (AI_CODE/) and fill in the
# real value there. ".env" is the file you edit. This file (".env.example")
# stays as a template with no real secret in it, safe to keep in the
# project/zip.
#
# NEVER paste the real key value into the chat conversation with Claude —
# only into the .env file, on your own machine or server.

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional, only needed once you move off the sandbox SQLite/local-Postgres
# setup to a real deployed server (SERVER_HARDWARE_SPECIFICATION.md):
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://helix_app:CHANGE_ME@localhost:5432/helix_nexus
